            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "These are appropriate, since the package managers here themselves only know where they installed neovim.\r\n\r\nIn the case this pr addresses (healthcheck for \"is a newer neovim published?\") all package managers hit the same npm registry and return the same data - using yarn was incidental and superfluous.\r\n\r\nProbably should've clarified that. Thanks for the catch... pushed a comment.",
